  "verbalization": "The compound [(3S,8S,9R,10R,12R,13S,14R,17R)-17-acetyl-3,8,14-trihydroxy-10,13-dimethyl-2,3,4,7,9,11,12,15,16,17-decahydro-1H-cyclopenta[a]phenanthren-12-yl] benzoate] is associated with SNB-78 through multiple indirect pathways. It is a target of Cycloeudesmol, which in turn targets SNB-78, and it also acts as a target of CHP-134 and VMRC-LCP, which also target SNB-78. These findings suggest a potential role for the compound in modulating SNB-78 activity, likely through the action of Cycloeudesmol or its downstream targets. The scores from the different paths indicate a moderate level of confidence in this relationship, with the highest score assigned to the compound's interaction with Cycloeudesmol and SNB-78. The evidence supports a mechanistic link between the compound and SNB-78, though the exact nature of the interaction remains to be elucidated."
